{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"第11段那种有重量、有把握的满足在这里进一步变得激越，甚至近乎承受不住；强烈的充实和明显的疼同时成立，却不是重新觉得“还要更多”。到段末，这股激越稍稍收住，但重量并没有卸掉。\",\"thread\":\"前面已经证明，这份满足即使不能安顿全部需要，也依然极其重要。于是现在再一次毫无保留地投入它，已经不同于早先单纯享受一份有限的快乐：人越充分承认自己究竟得到了什么，也越无法轻轻带过那个它始终不能触及的部分。疼不是对满足的否定，而正因为满足如此真实、如此重要，那个仍不能被它安顿的需要才第一次带上同样强的分量；所以这里可以既近乎欣喜若狂，又有一种逼人的痛。到了段末，两边都已经无须再靠更强烈的投入来证明，激越才会暂时收住，而不是得到解决。\",\"used\":\"第8段已经能够坦然、充分地肯定有限的满足；第9段确认尚未安顿并不是因为“得到得还不够”；第11段进一步确认，这份满足经过限度和不足的检验后仍然具有很大的重要性。\",\"new\":[\"当一份有限的满足的重要性被充分确认以后，再次深深投入它，可以从坦然的快乐变成近乎难以承受的激越，而不意味着重新向它索取全部答案。\",\"尚未安顿的需要不再只是强烈满足旁边留下的缺口；当满足本身的重要性已经无法怀疑时，这个缺口也会获得相应的重量，使充实本身同时带上真实的疼。\"],\"unexplained\":\"无\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2fdf378e-0dd9-44de-9536-37cccaba82e4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T221152887830Z", "elapsed_seconds": 50.36, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:12:43.267122+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "871db6aa68940ad0b8a47a3bcb5a13787830cf78e26894d54e333a3f76c2d9c9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T221152887830Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e430514fa0d16674bc45901e711d0ea2d1330907826b9e3abe3bcb5321b2f841"}}}
